  "description": "The Smok X-Priv Solo Mod is a high-performance vape mod, engineered for sub-ohm vapers seeking customisation and power in a super-compact, portable design. Capable of delivering up to 80W of power - activated by a large, tactile side fire key, the X-Priv Solo mod is powered by a single 18650 battery (sold separately), making it ideal for vapers who need a long-lasting and reliable device. One of the most impressive features of the X-Priv Solo is its 2.0” colour touch-screen display, which allows for easy navigation and customisation of vaping modes and settings. Switchable themes enable you to personalise your display, while the vibration reminder alerts you of any necessary adjustments. The screen conveniently displays key information such as wattage, puff count, resistance, and battery life, allowing you to monitor your vape with ease. Smok’s latest chipset ensures that the X-Priv Solo Mod delivers smooth performance while also providing a range of safety features such as over-heat, over-charge, and short-circuit protections. The mod also supports multiple vaping modes, including variable wattage, giving vapers more control over their experience. The X-Priv Solo is designed for both durability and style, with a sleek and ergonomic chassis that fits comfortably in your hand. It’s available in a range of luxurious finishes, including Black Shell, White Shell, Pale Blue, Silver Lines, Purple, and Pink. Pair the X-Priv Solo Mod with your favourite sub-ohm tank, such as the Smok TF-D Subtank (sold separately ), to enjoy rich flavour and dense vapour with high-VG e-liquids. Please Note: Batteries are NOT included with this mod.",
